Description: bash wrapper with LLM assistance
 aish runs bash on a pty and adds LLM assistance on top: command blocks with
 status lines, an inline editor, and an `ai` command for chat and agent actions
 with any OpenAI-compatible backend. Without an LLM it behaves like plain bash.
 Run `aish init` as your own user to set up your shell startup; the package
 never edits user files.

